WEBVTT

01:28.330 --> 01:34.930
Our Secret
EP04

01:50.970 --> 01:51.970
Jealous.

01:52.839 --> 01:53.800
Jealous.

01:54.520 --> 01:56.240
Good morning.

01:56.610 --> 01:57.880
Good morning.

01:58.290 --> 01:59.330
Good morning.

01:59.760 --> 02:00.760
Xianxian

02:02.200 --> 02:03.010
Dad

02:04.240 --> 02:06.370
Your mom told me that

02:06.650 --> 02:08.330
you want a phone?

02:08.690 --> 02:09.930
How about this?

02:10.089 --> 02:11.320
You use mine first,

02:11.480 --> 02:12.810
and I'll use my old PHS.

02:14.680 --> 02:15.810
No, dad, it's all right.

02:16.010 --> 02:18.890
I have nothing urgent,

02:19.560 --> 02:21.090
but just to keep contact with my classmates.

02:21.250 --> 02:23.810
It's okay for them to call me on
our fixed-line telephone.

02:24.170 --> 02:25.760
Alright.

02:26.010 --> 02:27.170
Invite your classmates

02:27.320 --> 02:28.320
to our home for a dinner

02:28.480 --> 02:30.320
some other day,

02:30.480 --> 02:32.810
to deepen your friendship.

02:33.680 --> 02:34.560
Okay.

02:38.760 --> 02:40.450
It's not your handwriting, right?

02:40.930 --> 02:42.600
It's pretty good.

02:43.400 --> 02:44.930
Yeah, it's Zhou Siyue's.

02:45.600 --> 02:47.320
I nodded off during the English lesson,

02:47.650 --> 02:49.320
and missed the key-points.

02:49.480 --> 02:51.530
So he wrote up the notes for me.

02:52.320 --> 02:54.530
Look at you, falling asleep in class again.

02:57.840 --> 03:00.320
Anyway, it's really nice of Siyue to

03:00.680 --> 03:03.040
exchange seats and write notes for you.

03:03.290 --> 03:04.730
He helped you a lot, right?

03:06.090 --> 03:07.120
Dad

03:08.760 --> 03:11.480
How did you know about exchanging seats?

03:17.480 --> 03:18.560
It can't be you who

03:19.040 --> 03:20.760
let him do all these stuff, right?

03:22.370 --> 03:23.530
No wonder I saw you two talking

03:23.680 --> 03:25.090
downstairs the other day.

03:25.810 --> 03:27.450
So that's why he's been so considerate.

03:28.040 --> 03:29.040
Well, Xianxian

03:29.250 --> 03:31.200
I asked Siyue

03:31.370 --> 03:33.930
for help so that you won't get

03:34.290 --> 03:35.370
-bullied.  -Dad

03:35.560 --> 03:36.450
Stop doing this.

03:36.650 --> 03:38.320
I don't need you to do these things.

03:38.890 --> 03:41.010
I can take care of myself well.

03:41.480 --> 03:42.760
Just leave me alone.

03:43.810 --> 03:44.760
Moreover,

03:45.040 --> 03:46.290
I don't want anyone to do

03:46.290 --> 03:48.730
something they don't like for me.

03:49.250 --> 03:49.810
It's not something

03:50.010 --> 03:51.650
we don't like, Xianxian.

03:51.890 --> 03:53.170
In fact, Siyue and I...

04:21.090 --> 04:21.930
Good morning.

04:22.250 --> 04:23.160
Morning.

04:23.760 --> 04:24.760
Just yourself?

04:24.970 --> 04:25.850
Where's your deskmate?

04:27.040 --> 04:28.160
No idea.

04:29.160 --> 04:30.370
Did you have a quarrel?

04:30.570 --> 04:31.570
No.

04:32.970 --> 04:35.000
We're not that close, anyway.

04:42.930 --> 04:44.970
I'm going for the teacher to recite the text.

04:53.760 --> 04:54.970
Well, look at you.

04:55.200 --> 04:57.000
Did you annoy your deskmate?

04:59.200 --> 05:00.090
She...

05:00.280 --> 05:01.320
She stood me up this morning.

05:01.480 --> 05:02.690
I almost got late for school.

05:03.930 --> 05:05.650
I don't think I have annoyed her.

05:09.040 --> 05:12.040
Truly old friends are like wine,

05:12.280 --> 05:13.650
the older, the better.

05:15.090 --> 05:16.040
Well done.

05:16.650 --> 05:17.720
I can see your efforts.

05:17.880 --> 05:18.720
Keep working.

05:19.160 --> 05:20.250
Thank you.

05:20.650 --> 05:22.410
I remember your deskmate is Zhou Siyue, right?

05:22.570 --> 05:24.320
Go find some time to practice with him.

05:24.530 --> 05:26.160
He's good at spoken English.

05:28.530 --> 05:30.200
Don't be shy.

05:30.480 --> 05:33.320
It's quite normal for classmates
to help each other.

05:34.370 --> 05:36.570
He's already helped me a lot.

05:36.690 --> 05:37.970
Alright, go back now.

05:43.880 --> 05:45.480
Are you serious? I just had one sip of Coke.

05:48.200 --> 05:49.090
I'm so sorry. I...

05:49.280 --> 05:51.410
I didn't mean it. I'm so sorry.

05:53.320 --> 05:55.600
-Just go back to class and wipe it.  -I'm sorry.

06:23.570 --> 06:24.720
Do you have nothing to do?

06:27.880 --> 06:30.090
Let's go, go.

06:30.970 --> 06:31.880
I'm so sorry.

06:36.200 --> 06:37.760
It's okay. I don't need it.

06:38.040 --> 06:38.810
Keep it.

06:40.480 --> 06:42.130
I'm sure you don't want to go back to class like this.

06:43.040 --> 06:43.970
Thank you.

06:47.650 --> 06:49.480
Why didn't you wait for me this morning?

06:51.040 --> 06:52.200
I have known everything already.

06:53.160 --> 06:55.370
It was my dad who asked you to take care of me, right?

06:56.370 --> 06:57.530
That's the reason?

06:59.200 --> 07:00.650
Sorry to trouble you.

07:01.280 --> 07:03.970
You don't have to do these if you don't want to.

07:08.760 --> 07:09.850
What are you laughing at?

07:10.760 --> 07:11.810
Never mind.

07:12.090 --> 07:13.650
You probably don't remember.

07:15.000 --> 07:16.000
What?

07:18.720 --> 07:19.930
Tell me.

07:21.600 --> 07:23.410
I owe you something, in fact.

07:24.760 --> 07:25.810
When I was five,

07:26.160 --> 07:27.480
I went back to my grandpa's home.

07:27.880 --> 07:29.410
I stayed at your home

07:29.930 --> 07:31.810
during the flood, do you remember?

07:36.040 --> 07:38.320
Hey, I wanna go to the toilet.

07:39.280 --> 07:42.880
It's outside there. Go yourself.

07:53.370 --> 07:55.440
You wetted the bed. Shame on you.

07:55.600 --> 07:57.130
There's no toilet.

07:57.320 --> 07:59.040
I couldn't hold it and I...

07:59.040 --> 08:00.720
It's right outside.

08:01.040 --> 08:02.440
I don't know how to use it.

08:03.130 --> 08:05.850
You are old enough to use the toilet.

08:06.040 --> 08:07.600
I'll tell my mom.

08:07.760 --> 08:08.930
Don't do it.

08:09.200 --> 08:10.720
I'll take you out

08:10.930 --> 08:12.090
next time when you're in town.

08:32.090 --> 08:34.369
I can't believe you had such an
embarrassing moment.

08:34.570 --> 08:35.480
You...

08:37.639 --> 08:39.480
Don't you dare say it to anyone.

08:42.450 --> 08:44.810
So where are we going to play around?

08:45.009 --> 08:46.010
What?

08:46.280 --> 08:47.690
You promised.

08:48.960 --> 08:50.600
You are fishing in troubled water.

08:52.080 --> 08:53.370
How could you treat me like this?

08:55.160 --> 08:56.330
At 1:00 pm on Saturday,

08:56.840 --> 08:58.280
wait for me in front of your home.

09:18.010 --> 09:19.250
What did you do last night?

09:21.690 --> 09:22.720
I just couldn't fall asleep.

09:24.690 --> 09:26.890
You seem to be in a good spirit.

09:27.040 --> 09:29.080
Go coach Ding Juncong for math later.

09:32.480 --> 09:33.840
I'm engaged this afternoon.

09:34.040 --> 09:35.400
What things do you have on weekend?

09:37.600 --> 09:39.210
I'm going to school for the blackboard newspaper.

09:39.930 --> 09:41.480
It will be checked next week.

09:41.640 --> 09:43.250
I remember you failed to be
elected as a class committee member.

09:44.960 --> 09:46.520
Just for help.

09:46.890 --> 09:48.400
Don't do it anymore.

09:48.600 --> 09:49.640
It's a thankless job,

09:49.890 --> 09:51.080
and may waste your study time.

10:26.160 --> 10:27.330
Checkmate.

10:28.040 --> 10:28.810
I'll take one move back.

10:28.810 --> 10:30.930
No, no. Don't do this.

10:32.210 --> 10:33.450
-Don't take it back.  -Brother Li.

10:33.690 --> 10:35.400
-You are here, Zhou.  -You are playing chess.

10:48.330 --> 10:49.210
Checkmate.

10:52.770 --> 10:54.210
-Are you sure?  -Checkmate.

10:56.640 --> 10:57.770
You can't take it back, understand?

10:57.960 --> 10:59.250
Excuse me then.

11:00.520 --> 11:02.210
It's my poor eyesight. I didn't see it.

11:02.480 --> 11:03.960
It has been five times, Uncle.

11:04.160 --> 11:05.250
One move, one move.

11:05.520 --> 11:06.600
Only one move.

11:07.370 --> 11:08.080
You're here.

11:08.570 --> 11:09.810
I'm gonna leave now, Uncle.

11:09.960 --> 11:10.890
Enjoy yourself.

11:12.480 --> 11:13.960
Can't take the joke, right?

11:16.480 --> 11:17.690
What's wrong today?

11:17.930 --> 11:19.010
Uncle, I'll take his place.

11:19.210 --> 11:20.130
What's the matter?

11:20.370 --> 11:23.330
It's your fault. You come so late.

11:23.770 --> 11:25.040
You little snail.

11:26.770 --> 11:27.930
Well, I'm a girl.

11:30.450 --> 11:31.400
What's the smell?

11:36.330 --> 11:37.280
Nothing.

11:42.600 --> 11:43.600
Fried chicken wings.

11:45.040 --> 11:45.770
Thank you, Sir.

11:45.770 --> 11:46.250
Okay.

11:46.840 --> 11:48.210
My treat this time.

11:50.160 --> 11:52.370
I'll never let a girl pay the bill.

11:54.570 --> 11:57.160
It seems that you often go out with girls.

11:57.370 --> 11:58.330
How could it be possible?

11:58.770 --> 12:00.160
Just eat.

12:01.690 --> 12:04.160
Are there any good spots in Shenhai?

12:04.370 --> 12:05.330
Good spots?

12:07.570 --> 12:08.520
Maybe the science and technology museum.

12:08.810 --> 12:10.330
The sea theater is okay, too.

12:11.720 --> 12:13.010
I know there's one bridge

12:13.210 --> 12:15.930
from which we can see the beautiful night view.

12:16.930 --> 12:18.890
Long years ago, it was a small fishing village.

12:19.480 --> 12:20.960
As the economy has grown recently,

12:21.570 --> 12:23.450
it gradually thrives.

12:25.720 --> 12:28.840
Sometimes I think you are really excellent.

12:29.080 --> 12:31.010
You know everything and can do everything.

12:34.080 --> 12:35.040
Compared with you,

12:35.370 --> 12:37.010
it's true.

12:39.370 --> 12:41.370
Can't you be a little humble?

12:44.570 --> 12:45.450
Ding Xian

12:46.840 --> 12:47.890
Actually,

12:48.520 --> 12:50.080
when you stop being so one-track minded,

12:50.720 --> 12:51.690
you are quite...

12:52.770 --> 12:54.890
What?

12:58.890 --> 13:00.600
Quite like a normal girl.

13:01.770 --> 13:03.450
I think you are the abnormal one.

13:05.400 --> 13:06.370
Okay.

13:07.520 --> 13:09.400
Inform me in advance

13:09.770 --> 13:11.040
when you wanna go somewhere.

13:11.400 --> 13:13.130
I'll show you around.

13:17.330 --> 13:18.280
Xianxian

13:20.160 --> 13:21.130
Su

13:21.330 --> 13:22.370
Why are you here?

13:22.640 --> 13:23.840
I come to buy some stuff.

13:24.690 --> 13:25.960
This is...

13:26.210 --> 13:27.160
your deskmate?

13:29.570 --> 13:31.210
You are quite close.

13:32.040 --> 13:33.280
Nuh...

13:34.600 --> 13:35.890
I think I have heard of him.

13:36.080 --> 13:38.960
He's Zhou Siyue, right?

13:39.330 --> 13:40.330
You know him?

13:40.570 --> 13:42.330
I've heard of him a lot. He's popular.

13:42.640 --> 13:44.520
By the way, have you listened to the

13:44.690 --> 13:45.330
CD I gave you?

13:45.480 --> 13:47.690
Yes, my teacher praised me for that.

13:48.280 --> 13:49.450
Thanks a lot, Su.

13:49.640 --> 13:50.770
It's all right.

13:50.930 --> 13:52.010
I'll ask Uncle Ding to

13:52.040 --> 13:53.520
bring you some more.

13:53.640 --> 13:54.080
Okay.

13:54.600 --> 13:55.250
Alright,

13:55.640 --> 13:57.040
you can go back now.

13:57.250 --> 13:58.810
Then see you later, bye.

13:58.960 --> 13:59.720
Bye-bye.

14:08.640 --> 14:10.600
Why have you eaten all my fish balls?

14:16.570 --> 14:18.130
I thought you were

14:19.400 --> 14:20.690
too happy to eat.

14:21.280 --> 14:22.770
That does not mean that you can have all of them.

14:22.930 --> 14:24.080
There's only one left.

14:28.520 --> 14:29.480
I'm full.

14:34.600 --> 14:36.040
Let's watch a movie this afternoon, okay?

14:36.890 --> 14:38.080
My treat.

14:39.480 --> 14:40.370
Okay.

14:53.960 --> 14:54.960
What movie do you want to watch?

15:00.330 --> 15:01.370
How about this?

15:01.570 --> 15:02.690
A Hollywood film.

15:03.720 --> 15:04.810
"2012"

15:05.570 --> 15:06.600
Okay, wait a second.

15:06.810 --> 15:07.720
I'll go get the tickets.

15:17.130 --> 15:18.130
Excuse me.

15:18.640 --> 15:19.570
What are you doing?

15:25.210 --> 15:26.160
Thank you.

15:32.330 --> 15:33.210
Thank you.

15:36.280 --> 15:37.330
What's this?

15:37.520 --> 15:38.570
3D glasses.

15:39.480 --> 15:40.690
Haven't you watched it before?

15:42.210 --> 15:43.160
I have.

15:43.720 --> 15:45.040
Of course I have.

15:46.480 --> 15:47.400
Let's go.

16:00.770 --> 16:01.400
Sorry.

16:14.770 --> 16:15.720
Excuse me.

16:28.890 --> 16:29.810
This row.

16:33.280 --> 16:34.160
Siyue

16:34.890 --> 16:35.810
Ding Xian

16:52.930 --> 16:53.810
You

16:54.330 --> 16:56.640
do feel a little upset, right?

16:57.770 --> 16:59.330
Upset about what?

17:01.160 --> 17:03.690
You should be upset.

17:08.360 --> 17:09.240
Idiot.

17:31.280 --> 17:32.760
Now I have returned your favor,

17:33.330 --> 17:34.760
and we are quits then.

17:37.090 --> 17:38.730
And I don't need your help then.

17:39.810 --> 17:40.610
For real?

17:41.490 --> 17:43.210
The final exam is coming.

17:43.610 --> 17:44.330
I'm wondering if there's anyone

17:44.490 --> 17:45.850
coming to ask for my help.

17:47.570 --> 17:50.000
Don't worry. It's not gonna be me.

17:55.490 --> 17:56.640
Ding Xian

17:57.610 --> 17:58.490
It's the class supervisor.

17:58.490 --> 18:00.160
Ding Xian, why are you running?

18:00.210 --> 18:01.400
Ding Xian, stop running.

18:11.330 --> 18:12.040
Hello?

18:12.160 --> 18:13.330
Hello, sir.

18:13.400 --> 18:14.330
Are you interested in buying a house?

18:14.520 --> 18:15.490
No, I'm not.

18:15.520 --> 18:17.240
Maybe you can learn about it first.

18:17.280 --> 18:18.760
It's a very good deal to buy it
with the housing loans.

18:18.810 --> 18:20.280
I don't need the loan either.

18:20.450 --> 18:21.640
Sir, it's okay to learn about the loans

18:21.640 --> 18:22.970
even if you don't buy the house.

18:23.210 --> 18:24.970
What's the point to know about the loans
if I don't buy the house?

18:28.760 --> 18:30.090
Has he gone?

18:31.160 --> 18:32.280
I got a house to live in.

18:33.090 --> 18:34.000
I'm not short of...

18:34.160 --> 18:35.810
Uh, I'm kind of short of money.

18:38.880 --> 18:40.280
Listen, how did you

18:40.850 --> 18:43.280
calculate the interest?

18:44.640 --> 18:46.090
You call this a low rate of interest?

18:46.240 --> 18:46.930
I'm telling you,

18:47.090 --> 18:48.730
I can't be fooled by you.

18:50.120 --> 18:51.730
You know who I am?

18:52.400 --> 18:53.040
I'm a teacher.

18:53.210 --> 18:54.160
I'm a math teacher.

18:54.330 --> 18:55.490
Your numbers...

19:00.450 --> 19:01.330
Keep saying.

19:02.880 --> 19:03.810
It's not right.

19:06.690 --> 19:07.640
Wait a second, hang in there.

19:07.640 --> 19:08.970
Hang in there.

19:11.360 --> 19:12.120
Hello?

19:12.970 --> 19:14.400
Well, tell me about your

19:14.490 --> 19:15.880
rate of interest.

20:18.730 --> 20:19.760
What do you think

20:20.160 --> 20:22.090
of the end of the world

20:23.040 --> 20:24.850
in 2012?

20:25.970 --> 20:27.090
I think there's gonna be an

20:27.330 --> 20:29.000
earthquake, a tsunami,

20:29.490 --> 20:31.330
a volcanic eruption.
Something like that.

20:31.730 --> 20:33.360
Just like what the movie showed.

20:34.400 --> 20:36.330
I don't think so.

20:37.090 --> 20:38.360
Even if we human beings do

20:39.490 --> 20:41.040
face extinction,

20:41.850 --> 20:43.280
we'll face the death

20:43.690 --> 20:45.160
with the last beauty,

20:45.690 --> 20:47.090
with the fireworks

20:47.610 --> 20:48.760
all over the sky.

20:51.610 --> 20:53.490
Could you think of something nice?

20:54.330 --> 20:55.760
Like what we will be

20:56.520 --> 20:57.880
doing in 2012.

21:02.360 --> 21:03.520
I may be enjoying the beauty of

21:04.640 --> 21:06.640
the West Lake in Hangzhou.

21:07.120 --> 21:08.160
It's Hangzhou again.

21:12.880 --> 21:13.970
What about you?

21:14.570 --> 21:15.690
Doing experiments

21:16.490 --> 21:17.640
in Huaqing.

21:18.450 --> 21:19.970
You wanna go to Huaqing University?

21:21.760 --> 21:22.850
Sure.

21:23.330 --> 21:24.640
You are good enough to

21:25.160 --> 21:26.760
be admitted.

21:30.520 --> 21:31.520
What about you?

21:32.760 --> 21:34.090
Don't you wanna go to

21:34.880 --> 21:36.210
see better scenery?

21:39.610 --> 21:40.520
I...

21:41.570 --> 21:42.850
I can't do it.

21:47.490 --> 21:48.640
A bigger goal is more

21:49.970 --> 21:51.760
worthy to challenge.

21:52.280 --> 21:53.400
Moreover,

21:56.640 --> 21:58.280
I have never seen anyone

21:58.610 --> 22:00.400
who works harder than you.

22:03.160 --> 22:05.760
Trust yourself, you can do it.

22:07.570 --> 22:08.760
A word to you:

22:11.160 --> 22:12.880
there's still a light of glory on the other side.

22:33.730 --> 22:34.490
Good one. It's good.

22:34.610 --> 22:36.160
I'll come back later.

22:39.810 --> 22:40.610
You are here.

22:41.160 --> 22:42.400
Good for you, Song.

22:42.610 --> 22:43.570
I'm so tired.

22:45.570 --> 22:46.090
Siyue

22:46.330 --> 22:46.880
How about coming to the countdown party

22:46.880 --> 22:48.090
with Little Monster?

22:48.360 --> 22:49.760
Little Monster.

22:49.930 --> 22:51.850
I thought you don't like her.

22:52.210 --> 22:54.040
Why do you invite her to the party?

22:54.760 --> 22:56.120
It was just a misunderstanding
at the beginning.

22:56.810 --> 22:57.640
It turned out that

22:57.850 --> 22:59.760
she's quite interesting

22:59.880 --> 23:00.930
when she holds her stubborn temper.

23:02.000 --> 23:03.120
What about you, Jiang Chen?

23:03.360 --> 23:04.610
Will you join us?

23:04.810 --> 23:06.090
Why didn't you ask me earlier?

23:06.240 --> 23:07.570
I already have plans.

23:08.640 --> 23:10.210
You just forget us

23:10.210 --> 23:12.240
once you got your new friends in high school.

23:12.490 --> 23:13.520
Look at him, dressing like this

23:13.690 --> 23:14.490
to play basketball here.

23:14.880 --> 23:15.640
I'm so busy.

23:15.690 --> 23:17.450
You are lucky to have me here.

23:17.520 --> 23:18.090
Come on.

23:18.400 --> 23:19.970
Don't fool us around.

23:20.520 --> 23:21.120
Go, just go play yourselves.

23:21.160 --> 23:21.880
Go, let's go.

23:21.880 --> 23:23.930
Leave him alone.

23:24.240 --> 23:24.970
Enjoy yourselves.

23:26.240 --> 23:27.040
What's on the card

23:27.040 --> 23:27.690
from Little Monster?

23:28.760 --> 23:29.400
What card?

23:29.760 --> 23:30.760
Her self-made card.

23:30.810 --> 23:31.690
She sent cards to me and Shadi.

23:31.760 --> 23:32.570
Haven't you received it yet?

23:37.730 --> 23:39.120
I'm leaving now, mom.

23:39.360 --> 23:40.570
Siyue, wait a second.

23:41.520 --> 23:42.930
I heard from Wanxian that Xianxian

23:43.120 --> 23:45.690
has been taking traditional Chinese

23:46.210 --> 23:47.490
medicine to nourish her vitality lately.

23:47.760 --> 23:48.930
Would you like to take some

23:49.120 --> 23:50.160
since you have been working so hard?

23:50.930 --> 23:52.330
I'm okay.

23:52.570 --> 23:54.400
She said it's quite bitter

23:54.690 --> 23:55.930
and quite effective.

23:57.520 --> 24:00.330
Xianxian takes it every day.

24:02.490 --> 24:03.330
Oh yeah?

24:14.240 --> 24:15.160
Morning.

24:15.850 --> 24:16.810
Morning.

24:18.120 --> 24:19.930
Is it Chinese medicine again made by your mom?

24:21.610 --> 24:22.640
Yes.

24:22.930 --> 24:24.120
My mom said that I need to take it

24:24.730 --> 24:26.730
to nourish my vitality since winter is coming.

24:27.520 --> 24:28.810
You sure need it.

24:29.040 --> 24:30.450
You are too weak,

24:30.610 --> 24:31.570
nodding off in class every day.

24:32.240 --> 24:33.640
I'm not weak, okay?

24:33.970 --> 24:35.000
Just finish it.

24:42.690 --> 24:44.090
Is it really this bitter?

24:46.360 --> 24:47.520
It does taste very bitter.

24:57.810 --> 24:58.690
A candy bar.

25:09.120 --> 25:10.040
Still feel bitter now?

25:10.970 --> 25:12.330
It's blueberry flavor.

25:19.000 --> 25:21.810
I remember you don't like to eat candy.

25:25.160 --> 25:26.450
Go to the class now.

25:26.640 --> 25:28.280
Won't you go with me?

25:29.000 --> 25:30.280
I'm waiting for Song Ziqi

25:30.570 --> 25:31.970
to give him something.

25:33.120 --> 25:34.090
You go first.

25:48.090 --> 25:49.210
Spend the holiday with us tonight, okay?

25:49.760 --> 25:51.090
You know I have no interest in

25:51.360 --> 25:52.880
celebrating holidays.

25:53.120 --> 25:55.040
Stop making an exception any more.

25:55.280 --> 25:56.810
You leave early every year.

25:57.040 --> 25:58.000
Can't we spend the

25:58.040 --> 25:59.570
New Year's Eve together like a family?

26:03.810 --> 26:05.090
Now let's begin the early exercises.

26:05.210 --> 26:07.120
Turn to page six in book seven and read

26:07.520 --> 26:09.360
the text we learned yesterday together.

26:23.730 --> 26:24.760
Where's my card?

26:29.210 --> 26:30.570
I knew it already.

26:31.570 --> 26:32.880
Kong Shadi and Song Ziqi have

26:32.880 --> 26:34.610
both received your cards in advance,

26:36.000 --> 26:37.000
while your deskmate
still has not received your card

26:37.000 --> 26:38.690
on New Year's Eve.

26:39.090 --> 26:42.000
You said you are not a fan of
celebrating holidays, didn't you?

26:42.400 --> 26:43.490
It's the holiday that I don't like,

26:43.690 --> 26:45.570
not the present.

26:49.040 --> 26:51.450
So everyone got it except me.

26:52.730 --> 26:53.850
Zhou Siyue, Ding Xian

26:54.570 --> 26:55.640
Go stand outside.

27:25.880 --> 27:27.690
I never said I didn't prepare for you.

27:28.120 --> 27:29.400
I draw it myself.

27:29.970 --> 27:32.160
The former one was messed by my brother,

27:32.490 --> 27:33.810
so I made a new one.

27:34.450 --> 27:35.730
I know it's a little bit late now.

27:38.930 --> 27:40.880
Don't open it now. Open it when you get back.

27:55.730 --> 27:56.730
Good for you.

28:00.240 --> 28:02.160
So when you were not with us,

28:02.450 --> 28:04.090
you didn't study either.

28:04.360 --> 28:05.520
To use the card-making time, your math

28:05.690 --> 28:07.450
grades can be improved at least 20 scores.

28:07.610 --> 28:08.930
Don't look a gift horse in the mouth.

28:08.930 --> 28:10.000
Give it back to me if you don't want it.

28:10.970 --> 28:11.810
Give me that.

28:14.330 --> 28:15.210
You two

28:15.400 --> 28:16.450
come to my office now.

28:25.120 --> 28:26.640
You are required to copy the text ten times?

28:26.850 --> 28:27.880
It's scaring.

28:28.490 --> 28:29.570
15 times.

28:29.810 --> 28:31.330
You ran into auntie during the rebuking.

28:31.490 --> 28:32.490
So there're five times more.

28:34.360 --> 28:36.930
It's really unlucky of you two.

28:37.210 --> 28:38.120
He is now in climacteric.

28:38.570 --> 28:40.090
You should thank god since he

28:40.090 --> 28:41.040
didn't let you do examination papers.

28:42.000 --> 28:44.490
Xianxian, what do you do on the New Year's Day?

28:44.640 --> 28:45.610
How about hanging out together?

28:48.160 --> 28:49.120
We'll talk about it later.

28:49.450 --> 28:50.400
I haven't received the results

28:50.570 --> 28:52.160
of the math quiz last time.

28:52.490 --> 28:53.610
Come on, you didn't join us last time.

28:53.810 --> 28:55.090
I was so bored

28:55.240 --> 28:56.000
to hang out

28:56.000 --> 28:57.280
with them.

29:02.000 --> 29:03.040
How about this?

29:03.610 --> 29:04.570
I'll go with you if I do well

29:04.730 --> 29:06.000
in the math exam

29:06.490 --> 29:08.090
this afternoon.

29:08.240 --> 29:09.000
Really?

29:09.210 --> 29:10.090
Then it's a deal.

29:10.240 --> 29:12.330
God bless you to get a high grade in the exam.

29:13.640 --> 29:15.160
Come on, one more bite.

29:15.570 --> 29:17.090
They provide you energy to copy.

29:17.850 --> 29:19.120
It's already over

29:19.880 --> 29:21.490
to trust her.

29:22.240 --> 29:23.330
Shut up.

29:23.690 --> 29:24.760
What?

29:24.970 --> 29:26.760
You felt boring to go out with us?

29:27.090 --> 29:28.040
We don't even wanna take you out.

29:28.160 --> 29:28.970
Right, Siyue?

29:30.120 --> 29:31.610
You can't blame Shadi.

29:31.880 --> 29:33.120
You were sort of boring, in fact.

29:35.120 --> 29:37.000
Come on, you're hurting my feelings.

29:37.760 --> 29:39.120
You seem like really enjoy
eating my foods.

29:39.330 --> 29:40.730
I can't see you're hurt.

29:45.160 --> 29:46.240
Sorry, I'm

29:46.450 --> 29:47.760
just sharing your burden

29:48.040 --> 29:49.970
in case you get too tired.

29:51.120 --> 29:52.690
That's sweet.

29:53.160 --> 29:54.760
Why don't you help me with the copying
since you wanna share my burden?

29:54.970 --> 29:56.210
I'm just a little hungry right now.

29:59.690 --> 30:00.520
Well,

30:00.930 --> 30:02.520
our handwritings are quite different.

30:04.210 --> 30:05.450
You've eaten all the meat.

30:06.400 --> 30:07.880
Alright, I'll do it.

30:10.850 --> 30:12.640
Don't laugh at my poor handwriting.

30:15.040 --> 30:16.160
Come here, Deng Wanwan.

30:16.640 --> 30:18.040
Help me to give the papers out.

30:30.640 --> 30:31.360
Xianxian

30:31.570 --> 30:32.810
How's your exam?

30:36.970 --> 30:38.040
Stop asking.

30:38.360 --> 30:40.040
I can't go out with you.

30:41.120 --> 30:42.570
You've improved a lot.

30:42.730 --> 30:43.640
Let me see it.

30:45.360 --> 30:46.760
Your score is twice higher than hers.

30:52.280 --> 30:53.280
Alright.

30:53.570 --> 30:55.240
Stop talking now.

30:56.240 --> 30:58.120
Look at your scores.

30:59.090 --> 31:00.730
Do you still have the nerve to talk around?

31:00.970 --> 31:02.730
Won't you be worried?

31:03.570 --> 31:05.610
As the holiday is coming,

31:05.810 --> 31:06.880
your hearts are already not

31:07.330 --> 31:08.810
in school, right?

31:09.490 --> 31:10.450
Being late for school,

31:11.000 --> 31:12.090
sleeping during class,

31:13.280 --> 31:15.210
and talking during lessons,

31:15.640 --> 31:17.120
you really impress me a lot.

31:18.760 --> 31:20.120
For this semester,

31:20.330 --> 31:22.520
some of you learned nothing but the

31:22.730 --> 31:25.120
talking skills with your
surrounding classmates.

31:25.520 --> 31:26.520
Your mouths just never stop.

31:26.730 --> 31:28.930
All I hear is your murmuring.

31:29.880 --> 31:31.760
The seats will be rearranged

31:32.240 --> 31:34.360
right after the final exam.

31:35.210 --> 31:36.880
I'll see how you will chat in this way.

31:41.730 --> 31:43.210
Sit back.

31:44.640 --> 31:45.930
No one can leave

31:46.240 --> 31:47.610
without my word.

31:48.520 --> 31:49.850
Take out your papers now.

31:52.280 --> 31:54.160
Sighing for what?

31:54.520 --> 31:56.160
I owe you nothing.

31:58.570 --> 32:00.880
Look at the last but one question on your paper.

32:02.570 --> 32:03.610
The 17th.

32:03.930 --> 32:04.970
It's worth ten points.

32:05.000 --> 32:06.330
We're gonna change seats next semester.

32:09.160 --> 32:11.400
Where are you gonna find
such a nice deskmate as me?

32:14.730 --> 32:16.000
Stop flattering yourself.

32:21.850 --> 32:23.810
Are you really gonna stay at home
for this whole holiday?

32:26.280 --> 32:28.160
Didn't he say you have improved a lot?

32:29.520 --> 32:31.090
It's far from a lot.

32:31.930 --> 32:33.520
It's only two places above
my former one.

32:39.330 --> 32:41.730
The score and the rank are different.

32:42.240 --> 32:44.240
No one can make huge progress in such a short time.

32:44.640 --> 32:46.360
You'd better relax yourself rather

32:46.570 --> 32:47.970
than keep pushing yourself like this.

32:49.930 --> 32:50.970
Moreover, I remember that you said

32:51.160 --> 32:53.210
it's good enough to raise for one place.

32:53.330 --> 32:54.640
Now you changed your mind.

32:56.400 --> 32:58.160
The final exam is coming
right after the holiday.

32:58.850 --> 33:00.450
I'm thinking that next semester...

33:03.000 --> 33:04.000
What?

33:07.160 --> 33:10.570
I wanna make it easier for the next semester.

33:11.000 --> 33:12.360
I have already been left behind.

33:12.970 --> 33:14.160
From Senior One to Senior Three,

33:14.360 --> 33:15.810
it's a short period.

33:16.000 --> 33:17.360
Easier?

33:17.730 --> 33:18.360
Alright.

33:18.760 --> 33:20.490
Listen, it's just Senior One now.

33:21.090 --> 33:22.520
Let me remind you.

33:22.730 --> 33:24.160
It can only get harder, not easier.

33:26.160 --> 33:27.570
Listen to me,

33:27.760 --> 33:29.240
the college entrance examination

33:29.610 --> 33:34.040
is a narrow bridge for
millions of people to cross.

33:34.880 --> 33:35.730
Okay.

33:36.240 --> 33:38.400
You remember this line quite clear.

33:38.690 --> 33:39.450
But

33:40.570 --> 33:41.850
stop pretending to work hard,

33:41.850 --> 33:43.520
all of you.

33:43.930 --> 33:46.160
The results can't lie to you.

33:46.930 --> 33:47.850
Alright.

33:48.880 --> 33:51.730
This holiday only has three days,

33:51.970 --> 33:54.880
which are not a period for you to relax.

33:55.450 --> 33:56.330
If anyone makes the same mistakes

33:56.490 --> 33:58.120
once again after the holiday,

33:58.490 --> 33:59.810
copy it ten times.

34:00.210 --> 34:01.210
Do you understand?

34:01.490 --> 34:03.810
Yes.

34:05.280 --> 34:06.330
You are dismissed.

34:08.450 --> 34:09.250
The class is over.

34:09.400 --> 34:10.529
Come on, let's go.

34:12.600 --> 34:13.880
Go. Let's go.

34:42.969 --> 34:44.690
The seats will be rearranged

34:44.930 --> 34:46.969
right after the final exam.

34:47.319 --> 34:49.160
I'll see how you will chat in this way.

34:54.400 --> 34:56.250
To work harder, if I don't want a new deskmate.

35:05.800 --> 35:07.010
Look at the young couple,

35:07.210 --> 35:08.320
they are perfect for each other.

35:10.640 --> 35:12.450
Xianxian did not step out of her room
for the whole day.

35:12.640 --> 35:13.690
Is there anything wrong?

35:13.880 --> 35:14.730
I'll have a look.

35:15.560 --> 35:17.210
All other parents are only too anxious

35:17.210 --> 35:19.290
to see their kids working hard.

35:19.320 --> 35:21.080
Look at you, all you do

35:21.160 --> 35:22.730
is keeping bothering her.

35:23.160 --> 35:24.360
She should alternate work with rest.

35:24.400 --> 35:25.640
Besides, it's on holiday now.

35:25.930 --> 35:26.880
Don't fuss.

35:27.080 --> 35:28.840
She'll get out herself when she's tired.

35:29.010 --> 35:29.880
Just leave her alone.

35:30.490 --> 35:31.010
Here,

35:31.360 --> 35:32.080
eat this.

35:33.490 --> 35:35.560
Mom, I wanna go out to set off fireworks.

35:35.770 --> 35:36.530
No.

35:37.080 --> 35:38.290
I don't care. I'm going out.

35:38.320 --> 35:38.930
Keep your voice down.

35:38.930 --> 35:39.490
I'm going out.

35:39.600 --> 35:40.050
I'm setting off fireworks.

35:40.050 --> 35:40.600
Hush, stop shouting.

35:41.050 --> 35:41.930
Alright, alright.

35:42.250 --> 35:43.250
Just take him out

35:43.400 --> 35:44.880
since he wants the fireworks.

35:45.050 --> 35:46.050
It's quite lively out there.

35:46.400 --> 35:48.010
Well, it's a good time for Xianxian

35:48.210 --> 35:50.010
to relax herself.

35:50.160 --> 35:51.560
Wait a second, I'll go get your sister.

35:51.730 --> 35:52.490
Okay, okay.

35:53.120 --> 35:54.490
All you know is playing.

35:56.530 --> 35:57.250
Xianxian

36:17.530 --> 36:19.050
Okay, take a picture now.

36:19.880 --> 36:21.120
It goes out very soon.

36:21.290 --> 36:22.160
Hurry up.

36:23.770 --> 36:25.120
Do I look good with this posture?

36:25.530 --> 36:26.160
Yeah.

36:26.320 --> 36:26.970
Really?

36:27.800 --> 36:29.080
You go down a little.

36:29.600 --> 36:30.450
Like this?

36:31.050 --> 36:31.600
No.

36:31.840 --> 36:33.560
Just have a look to see if I look good.

36:33.600 --> 36:35.080
Okay. I'm looking at it. You look great.

36:35.160 --> 36:35.930
You didn't look.

36:35.930 --> 36:36.560
I did.

36:36.730 --> 36:37.800
Have you taken my legs?

36:39.320 --> 36:40.530
Hurry up. It's going out.

36:41.160 --> 36:42.560
Okay, look at it.

36:46.490 --> 36:47.970
What's that?

36:48.320 --> 36:49.730
You told me to squat down.

36:49.930 --> 36:50.840
Where's my face?

36:52.560 --> 36:53.530
So what now?

36:54.690 --> 36:56.290
It's going off now.

36:56.450 --> 36:57.450
Buy me a new one.

36:58.010 --> 36:59.400
Alright. I'll get you a new one.

37:00.450 --> 37:01.120
All is yours.

37:01.880 --> 37:02.840
Practice taking photos here.

37:10.010 --> 37:10.970
Broke again.

37:12.120 --> 37:13.560
You ask for it.

37:14.640 --> 37:15.690
I have no choice.

37:15.880 --> 37:17.250
You know, we grow up together.

37:17.600 --> 37:19.490
Everyone would know when she throws a hissy fit,

37:19.640 --> 37:20.690
and it's my job to amuse her.

37:20.970 --> 37:22.450
You know about Pavlov's dog, right?

37:24.080 --> 37:25.160
I'm the dog.

37:26.250 --> 37:28.530
I'm not sure about the conditional reflex.

37:28.800 --> 37:30.360
But you are indeed like a dog.

37:31.530 --> 37:32.840
I'll bite you to death.

37:35.160 --> 37:36.730
Hey, it's almost 12 o'clock.

37:37.050 --> 37:37.840
Set off the fireworks now.

37:40.010 --> 37:41.010
Not in the mood?

37:41.490 --> 37:42.250
What's wrong?

37:43.210 --> 37:44.450
Too few people.

37:45.250 --> 37:46.800
I can't help feeling bored.

37:51.690 --> 37:53.320
You want Little Monster to be here, right?

37:53.800 --> 37:55.360
I get it now, Mr. Zhou.

37:55.770 --> 37:57.080
You don't want her to feel lonely

37:57.290 --> 37:57.930
at home, right?

37:58.120 --> 37:59.160
It's not the thing.

37:59.360 --> 38:00.080
So who do you wanna call?

38:00.210 --> 38:01.360
Come on, tell me.

38:04.600 --> 38:06.640
I'm trying to make you feel better
to invite Ding Xian.

38:07.320 --> 38:07.770
What do you mean?

38:07.930 --> 38:08.450
Think about this.

38:08.640 --> 38:09.250
Kong Shadi will feel happy

38:09.450 --> 38:11.450
once she comes, right?

38:11.640 --> 38:12.930
They'll play together

38:13.210 --> 38:14.640
and you'll be free.

38:15.290 --> 38:16.490
Then we two...

38:21.640 --> 38:23.080
Mr. Zhou, good for you.

38:23.250 --> 38:24.320
Right, right.

38:24.490 --> 38:25.450
Look, Song Ziqi,

38:25.640 --> 38:27.050
I got two different one.

38:28.450 --> 38:29.320
Great.

38:29.530 --> 38:31.290
Other kids must envy you.

38:31.490 --> 38:32.320
Let's go.

38:32.530 --> 38:33.450
Let's go now.

38:33.730 --> 38:34.600
Where to go?

38:35.320 --> 38:36.930
Go find you a cameraman.

38:59.050 --> 38:59.930
Xianxian

39:00.160 --> 39:02.400
We go to watch the firework show with Congcong.

39:02.840 --> 39:04.360
There are fruits on the table.

39:04.600 --> 39:05.490
Suit yourself and don't get too tired.

39:05.730 --> 39:06.640
Call us

39:06.840 --> 39:08.450
if you wanna come.

39:17.930 --> 39:20.360
I also want to watch it with everyone.

39:26.840 --> 39:27.730
Little Monster

39:28.400 --> 39:29.160
Ding Xian

39:29.800 --> 39:30.600
Ding Xian

39:31.210 --> 39:32.080
Little Monster

39:32.770 --> 39:33.290
Come out!

39:38.530 --> 39:39.730
What are you doing here?

39:40.120 --> 39:41.250
They said they won't go to watch the fireworks

39:41.530 --> 39:43.120
without you.

39:43.400 --> 39:44.800
Don't pass the buck to me.

39:45.320 --> 39:46.600
Right, get down now.

39:47.250 --> 39:49.250
Well, it's almost 12 o'clock.

39:49.360 --> 39:50.210
We'll catch a cold

39:50.210 --> 39:51.560
if you don't get down right now.

39:52.050 --> 39:52.690
I'm coming.

40:18.400 --> 40:19.770
We won't make it.

40:20.490 --> 40:22.600
We may miss the fireworks show?

40:25.290 --> 40:28.050
You would catch it if you didn't come to me.

40:29.770 --> 40:30.160
It's all right.

40:30.160 --> 40:31.560
Look at the traffic,

40:32.120 --> 40:33.800
we can go somewhere else in fact.

40:34.160 --> 40:35.290
Isn't it

40:35.640 --> 40:37.210
too late now?

40:40.400 --> 40:41.970
Get off the car now, and I have an idea.

40:44.320 --> 40:45.800
Come on, keep the changes.

40:52.210 --> 40:53.400
I know there's a place.

40:53.600 --> 40:54.770
We can make it.

40:56.880 --> 40:57.730
Let's go.

40:58.450 --> 40:59.490
Go, go.

42:03.450 --> 42:04.730
I'm so sorry.

42:06.290 --> 42:07.120
It's okay.

42:07.970 --> 42:09.120
It's okay.

42:09.400 --> 42:11.320
The traffic is quite heavy anyway.

42:11.450 --> 42:13.320
And we've seen it just now.

42:18.010 --> 42:18.800
Look!

42:20.640 --> 42:22.290
Oh my god, look. Fireworks.

42:23.560 --> 42:24.290
Fireworks.

42:24.730 --> 42:25.530
Awesome.

42:27.290 --> 42:28.770
Happy New Year!

42:28.970 --> 42:30.360
Happy New Year!

42:36.320 --> 42:37.600
Happy New Year!

42:52.320 --> 42:54.250
Happy New Year!

42:54.400 --> 42:55.840
Happy New Year!

42:56.400 --> 42:59.080
Happy New Year!
